From 84e19926a6374effb1bd818f5ebc19dbb5e07c27 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: T S Rameshkumar <rameshkumar.t@phytecembedded.in>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:59:51 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] arm64: dts: freescale: Add PHYTEC phyBOARD-Polis carrier
 board and peripheral overlays

Add device tree source for PHYTEC phyBOARD-Polis i.MX8MM RDK carrier board
supporting Android 15. Configure USDHC2 SD card slot, UART3 serial console,
USB OTG, and audio interfaces. Add display and camera overlays for PEB-AV-10,
PEB-EVAL-01, VM-016, VM-017, and VM-020 sensor modules with FPD-Link expansion.

Signed-off-by: T S Rameshkumar <rameshkumar.t@phytecembedded.in>
